window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>The Little Mermaid</i> meets <i>The Princess Bride</i> in this spicy and addictive follow up to the bestselling <i>A Thorn in Every Heart</i>.</p> <p><b>Odessa Ashwater knows there's a fine line between love and hate.</b></p> <p>Loving a siren inevitably leads to death or insanity. Nevertheless, after Dessa rescued Crown Prince Kastian of Hydratta from drowning, she was convinced they were destined for each other. Now, a century later, she's sure the only thing they're fated for is to destroy each other.</p> <p><b>Kastian Stormbreaker is unshakable.</b></p> <p>Many years ago, he lost his family, his crown, his freedom, and the opportunity to find his soul-bonded mate all in a single night. Now, nothing can break through his calm facade. Nothing, except the mesmerizing siren whose captivating beauty and fierce animosity he can't resist.<br> <br> When an enemy from Kastian's past asks for Odessa's hand in marriage, she views it as an ideal chance to form a strategic alliance for her court while distancing herself from Kas. <b>But when the engagement turns deadly and Odessa gets in over her head, Kastian is the only one who can save her from drowning.</b></p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
